This is the bootstrap build system, a simple public domain POSIX make implementation,
created by Ron Yorston (rmyorston) under the name 'pdpmake'. This software was re-licenced
under our standard licence, The Nuovi Orizzonti Company Open License Version 3, viewable
at http://thenuoviorizzonticompany.org/license/openlicense/3.txt
However, you should probably be aware, since this software is public domain, you can
simply choose to ignore this license. Although, since the new license is also public
domain, there is not really a point in doing so. All pieces of code not dedicated
to the public domain have been removed.

To bootstrap this without make, simply run

$ cc -o ../make *.c

from this directory, or

$ cc -o make bootstrap/*.c

from the main source directroy.

Thank you, Rom Yorston (https://github.com/rmyorston) for providing this wonderful
piece of software.
